Task: optimize_over subset support

The sweep/assemble helpers added in 0d9bebb already implemented the subset
semantics; this commit adds the missing regression coverage:

- optimize_over=[0] on a 2-D range reproduces the scalar 1-D result.
- optimize_over=[1] mitigates a p2-only conflict at p2*=3.
- Non-optimized ICPs are queried at each xApp's own preferred coordinate.
- Out-of-range, empty, and duplicate indices are rejected.

